   (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available)

Now authorize transport leg loading:

